# --- Deployment ---------------------------------------------------------
# Render builds from the git repository, so the Docker runtime files MUST
# be tracked: an ignored Dockerfile makes Render fail with
#   "failed to read dockerfile: open Dockerfile: no such file or directory"
# Dockerfile / .dockerignore contain no secrets — every env value lives in
# the Render dashboard (or render.yaml's sync: false placeholders).
#  · render.yaml        → only used by the Blueprint deploy flow; safe to
#                         keep local if the service is created by hand.
#  · DEPLOYMENT.md      → local documentation, not needed to build.
/render.yaml
/DEPLOYMENT.md
